# Cargo build output.
#
# Excluded here so a build inside the crate directory is ignored without
# depending on the repository root, and so `bun run smoke`'s template copy never
# carries a developer's build directory into a rehearsal. `apps/backend/media`
# has the identical file for the same reason.
target/

# Generated by `tauri-build`, from `tauri.conf.json` and `capabilities/*.json`:
# the resolved ACL manifests and the platform config schemas.
#
# Not committed, and the reason is that a stale schema is worse than a missing
# one: `bun run guard` classifies `src-tauri/gen` as generated output, so a build
# can create it without failing anything, and a reviewer would be asked to read a
# file a build produces. Regenerating it is `cargo check` in this directory.
gen/
